'''Dentention Block B7''' was a detention block on [[Grand Admiral]] [[Mitth'raw'nuruodo|Thrawn's]] [[command ship]] ''[[Chimaera]]'', where [[Ezra Bridger]] was imprisoned during the [[Rescue of Alexsandr Kallus|mission to rescue]] the [[Imperial Security Bureau]] [[agent]], and secretly [[Fulcrum]], [[Alexsandr Kallus|Kallus]],<ref name="TIE" /> in [[2 BBY]].<ref name="Date">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]'' dates the events of "[[Through Imperial Eyes]]" to [[2 BBY]].</ref>

